    "name": "Rounded rectangular perimeter frame",
    "description": "A single-piece, closed-loop rectangular frame with long straight rails, large-radius corners, a continuous central opening, broad annular front and rear lands, a defined inner aperture wall, and a rounded outer perimeter shell. No discrete fastener holes, bosses, hinges, or detachable joints are visible.",
